sequenceDiagram
    title Variant resolved once per SSR request, shared across the whole funnel
    participant Browser
    participant NextSSR
    participant AppMiddleware
    participant AmplitudeExperiment
    participant InitialStore
    participant ReactTree

    Browser->>NextSSR: GET any rides page
    NextSSR->>AppMiddleware: appMiddleware(ctx)
    AppMiddleware->>AppMiddleware: parseCookies AMP_device_id and AMP_user_id
    AppMiddleware->>AmplitudeExperiment: fetchV2 with user properties
    AmplitudeExperiment-->>AppMiddleware: variants map
    AppMiddleware->>AppMiddleware: getMultiVariant rides_flight_capture
    AppMiddleware-->>NextSSR: activeTreatment off or variantA or variantB
    NextSSR->>InitialStore: AppMiddlewareValues carries experiments
    InitialStore->>ReactTree: hydrate with the assigned arm
    ReactTree->>ReactTree: selectFlowStepMap picks the step map
    ReactTree->>ReactTree: AvoParams stamps variant on every event
    ReactTree-->>Browser: first paint already in the assigned arm
